# Ship the three small collaboration artifacts too. Each is a task someone can pick up, and each is
# referenced by name in the docs — a doc that points at an ignored file is a dead end for a teammate.
# NOTE the re-ignore line inside each directory: un-ignoring the DIRECTORY alone would also un-ignore
# `llm_cache/` (3,694 vote JSONs) and the label parquets, which must stay out of the repo.
!/data/labeling/
/data/labeling/*
!/data/labeling/spot_check.csv
!/data/labeling/company_industry_todo.csv
!/data/quality/
/data/quality/*
!/data/quality/unmapped_skills.csv

